                                                "sense_id": "138c529f-8b7d-381c-9b46-e32cc96d7798",
                                                "text": "An interim report by investigators from the Rail Accident Investigation Branch found extensive evidence of crushed leaf mulch on the railhead at many sites on the approach to Salisbury Tunnel Junction."
                                            }
